What is Raymond Interactive Theatre?
====================================

	It's a new approach to computer mediated entertainment that we hope 
you'll find refreshing. It is about experience, so rather then give you a 
lengthy description, we invite you to come, be our guest, and try it.
	As a guest, you'll be able to wander about, experiencing the various 
activities, viewing the theatre and it's participants. After a bit, we'll
bring you back here again where you can begin an account if you'd like.
To do this, type 3, at the information menu.
